# ROS 2 Architecture & Control Pipeline

## Hierarchical Control Flow

```
QuadControlTarget (velocity, height, yaw)
       ↓  [/quad_control_target]
Gait Sequencer  (SimpleGait / AdaptiveGait / BioGait + RaibertFootStepPlanner)
       ↓  GaitSequence
MPC (acados) — convex GRF optimization over horizon
       ↓  WrenchSequence
SwingLegController
       ↓
WBC (ARC-OPT / TSID) — whole-body QP
       ↓  [/leg_cmd or /leg_joint_cmd]
leg_driver — IK, Jacobian, safety enforcement
       ↓  [/joint_cmd]
Simulator (Drake) OR Motor Driver (Unitree/mjbots)
       ↓  [/joint_states, /imu_measurement, /contact_state]
state_estimation (Invariant EKF) → [/quad_state]
```

## Key ROS Topics

| Topic | Type | Direction |
|-------|------|-----------|
| `/quad_control_target` | `QuadControlTarget` | joystick → controller |
| `/quad_state` | `QuadState` | state_est → controller |
| `/leg_cmd` | `LegCmd` | controller → leg_driver |
| `/joint_cmd` | `JointCmd` | leg_driver → motor/sim |
| `/joint_states` | `JointState` | motor/sim → state_est |
| `/gait_state` | `GaitState` | controller → state_est |
| `/clock` | `Clock` | simulator (use `use_sim_time:=true`) |

## Package Responsibilities

- **`controllers/`**: `mit_controller_node.cpp` is the main node. MPC in `src/mit_controller/mpc.cpp`. WBC in `wbc_arc_opt.cpp`. Configs in `config/mit_controller_sim_go2.yaml` etc.
- **`drivers/`**: `leg_driver.cpp` handles IK and safety. Motor drivers are robot-specific.
- **`simulator/`**: `drake_simulator.cpp` publishes `/clock`. Visualizer at `localhost:7000`.
- **`state_estimation/`**: Only needed on real hardware; Drake provides ground-truth state in sim.

## Simulation Launch Order

```bash
ros2 launch simulator simulator.launch.py sim:=go2
ros2 launch drivers leg_driver_launch.py sim:=go2
ros2 launch controllers quad_stand_up.launch.py sim:=go2
ros2 launch controllers mit_controller.launch.py sim:=go2
```

## Joint Naming Convention

12 joints: `{fl,fr,bl,br}_{abad,shoulder,knee}` (4 legs × 3 DOF).
